      "writtenOn": "2014-08-01T20:55:02Z",
      "side": 1,
      "message": "I don\u0027t like this, it only works because slave_addr is the first element of the struct. If someone reordered struct, it would break in a non-obvious way. intf already points to beginning of struct, so just use that.",
      "revId": "a35f79c70778e65036231a0dc86c0185b03533ac",
